>
> Then you aren't thinking of botpi and tirxu, but vasru (possibly patxu) and
> mlatu

I know I'm not thinking of botpi and tirxu. I'm thinking of bottles
and tigers, of bottiglie and tigri, of animals of species Panthera
tigris.

